Here's a minimal example:

```go
func main() {
    ch := make(chan int)
    for i := 0; i < 2; i++ {
        go func(n int) { ch <- n * n }(i)
    }
    fmt.Println(<-ch, <-ch)
}
```
Both sends complete once main receives.

